  m_text: 'Electrical Fire (Class C)

    Extinguish with: CO2 (Carbon Dioxide).

    Warning:
    Do NOT use water.

    Note: Do not forget to shut off the electrical panel in
    the event of an electrical fire.


    Solid Material Fire (Class A)

    (Paper,
    wood, cloth)

    Extinguish with: Water or foam.


    Cooking Oil / Fat Fire
    (Class F)

    (Frying oil)

    Extinguish with: Dry chemical powder.

    Warning:
    Do NOT use water; it causes splattering/splashing.'
